    "body": "Somewhat relevant comment on the original `sizes=auto` discussion: https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/4654#issuecomment-495266624\n\nThere is also the inverse problem - `object-fit: cover` might fetch an image that's too small, and scale it to fit the object area.\nSeems like what we really need is to find a comprehensive solution for 2D-base auto-sizing?",
