    "body": "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-images/#the-object-fit changes the concrete object size, so maybe this is why we used it for `sizes=auto`. The example in OP doesn't use `width` and `height` attributes which are recommended in the spec, and would give an aspect ratio I think.\n\ncc @whatwg/css ",
