    "body": "@noamr the width and height attributes set `aspect-ratio` in the UA stylesheet. I think the intent is indeed that they should be used to \"set\" the aspect ratio, and you can override the box dimensions with CSS.\n\nWe can maybe still add the `h` descriptor, but then I think the purpose should be to improve resource selection rather than only set aspect ratio.",
